       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose looks like it might be a mistake.\n\n**The problem:**\n- **Each dose:** 1600 mg is twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times a day comes to 6400 mg/day. That's twice the usual prescription maximum of 3200 mg/day.\n- **Risk:** At this level, there's a real chance of GI bleeding, kidney injury and other NSAID toxicity, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\n**What you might have meant:**\n1. **1600 mg/day total:** 400 mg by mouth four times a day.\n2. **The maximum regimen:** 800 mg by mouth four times a day, which is 3200 mg/day.\n3. **Another dose or frequency.**\n\nPlease tell me which one you want. If you really do want 1600 mg four times a day, confirm that and give me the clinical reason. I'll then enter it with a note recording that it's above the usual maximum and why."
      }
